WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.520
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.990
Headmaster, I beg of you.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.330
This is about Spice Chord, I presume. Kisaragi gave me the details.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.580
Right. However, I—

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:28.420
You went to Venus Ark to learn about 
Star Premium Rare Coords at <i>my</i> suggestion.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.050
I fail to see why I should hinder you now.

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:33.260
I permit you to keep your own brand.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:36.430
Headmaster! Thank you so much!

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:37.300
However—

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:41.180
You must promise to obtain Star Wings.

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:42.810
Yes!

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.110
I, Sakuraba Rola,

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:55.360
hereby accept the mantle of Spice Chord muse.

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:58.370
What is your vision for the brand's future?

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:02.620
I may have inherited it from Kisaragi Tsubasa-senpai,

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:07.880
but I plan to love and develop Spice Chord in my own way!

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.320
Hey, Koharu.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.400
How should I do this part?

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.570
You should use an overcast stitch there. {close enough I hope}{sure hopefully}

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.070
Oh yeah!

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:07.410
Your sewing is so beautiful.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.500
How did you get that good?

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:14.130
Put care into each and every stitch. That's the secret.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.090
Is it?

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.380
Man, my shoulders are getting stiff.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.880
Let's take a breather.

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:24.850
Here you are.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.010
Thanks.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:35.190
Sorry for taking so much of your time every day when you're busy with your own things.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.070
It's fine, I don't mind.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:39.530
I'm glad to be of help.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:46.030
It's still gonna be a while until I finish.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:51.160
Completing a dress really does take a lot of time and effort.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:57.920
It does. The weeks it takes to finish even a single dress can be exhausting.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:04.180
I know. But what really surprised me was how much I've learned since I started.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:10.100
Just by using a different type of cloth or thread color, you'll end up with a completely different dress.

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:14.400
There are infinite ways to design a dress, huh?

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.770
There really are.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:21.400
You'll face a lot of tough decisions, but when you get it perfect, the feeling is incomparable.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:22.900
All right!

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:26.700
I'll definitely make the best dress ever!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.620
Yeah!

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.330
Another hot day.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.790
It's the height of summer.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:41.760
Oh right, Rola. How's your Premium Rare Dress coming along? Doing okay?

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:47.550
Yeah, Koharu's giving me advice along the way. 
I'm making progress every day.

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.060
That's great. You can do it!

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.730
I'm excited to see what you do with Spice Chord!

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:53.600
Thanks.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:55.730
Go! {in the CCs, this is "No". I don't get it}{yes no}{hopefully nobody cares}

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:56.190
Yes!

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:56.480
Go!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:56.900
Yes!

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:57.230
Go!

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:57.650
Yes!

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.900
Doesn't it feel like they're a lot more active than usual today?

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.820
I wonder if something's going on.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:08.570
Look out!

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.870
Wh-What's that?

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.580
Nice reaction.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:15.620
Elza-san.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:17.120
And Juli-san.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.960
Congratulation!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.750
That startled me.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:23.760
What's this?

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.380
A participation card for Venus Wave. {or participation}

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:27.470
Venus Wave?

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:32.640
It's Juli's Venus Wave seminar!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:38.440
Venus Wave is an idol event organized and hosted by Venus Ark.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:45.860
Elza-sama selects idols to participate based on whom she deems worthy or has high expectations for.

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:51.580
Additionally, the points you earn at this event have a large effect on your Aikatsu Ranking.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:53.160
The Aikatsu Ranking!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:56.790
A ranking of idols from all around the world. {yes thanks, I remembered}

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:01.500
Points are earned at concerts, events, and the like as the most popular idol is determined.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:07.510
By the way, you two are the first students from Four Star Academy ever to be invited.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:08.760
Do you accept?

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:11.300
Are we really the first?

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.100
Of course we're in.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:15.850
Quite splendid. {this will have to be a thing from now on. edit now or forever hold your peace}{holding my peace}

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.980
Did you know, Koharu-chan?

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:19.850
Yeah.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:24.860
Venus Wave has been held in countries all over the globe.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:30.740
It's usually mostly students from Venus Ark, 
but now Four Star is represented!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:33.410
Yume-chan, Rola, you made history!

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:35.040
Is it that big a deal?

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.750
Oh, it's Mahiru-chan.

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.250
Yume.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.750
Bonjour! Are you all doing well?

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:46.340
Mahiru-chan! Yozora-senpai!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.760
It's nice to see you again.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.260
Where are you right now?

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:51.640
In Paris, France.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:58.020
This is the city of fashion, where even a stroll down the street can be educational. Onee-chan brought me.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:02.310
Being able to walk the streets of Paris with you makes me so happy!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:04.020
Stop that, Onee-chan.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.980
Those two are the same as always.

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:06.980
You're in the way.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:07.740
Yep!

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:08.780
More importantly!

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:12.450
Yume, Rola, we heard you'll be entering Venus Wave.

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:14.620
Huh? How did you know?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.290
Everyone does.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:21.920
The announcement of Venus Wave has become the talk of the town over here.

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:27.050
People are excited, even taking bets on who'll win.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:32.930
By the way, the top pick is by and far Hanazono Kirara.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:34.470
I'm not surprised.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:36.430
So hey, what about us?

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:40.350
To be honest, you're not even on the radar.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:42.060
What?! Seriously?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:45.610
Kirara-chan has fans all around the world.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:50.990
You two may be top idols in Japan, but your influence doesn't expand any further than that.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.490
The world is harsh.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:55.870
That gets me going.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:08:00.580
It's exactly because we're unknowns that we can use this as a chance to get our names out!

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:03.330
Rola... you're right!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.290
If I won...

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.760
Everyone, the results are in!

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:13.090
The top star of Venus Wave is...

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:20.100
Four Star Academy's Nijino Yume!

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:26.110
Thank you all so much!

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:27.400
Yume Nijino.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.110
Elza-san.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:35.240
You... are perfect!

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:43.160
I might become the world's top idol!

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:45.670
That's the spirit.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:48.960
Now that you're in, you have to aim for the top.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.210
Yume, Rola, do your best!

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.170
We'll be cheering you on from France!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.880
Yeah, we will.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:58.550
As representatives of Four Star Academy, we can't afford to lose.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:08:59.810
Right, Rola?

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:00.850
Yeah!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:07.060
Are you going to use this dress?

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.980
Yeah, I need to get it done.

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:14.570
Huh? Isn't that part different from the design?

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:18.070
New ideas popped into my head as I was making it.

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:20.080
And you incorporated those changes?

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.330
I want to take this on with my best possible dress.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:25.580
Okay!

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.540
Can I help you with anything?

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.130
Thanks.

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:34.970
But I want to finish it with my own two hands.

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:40.850
I inherited Spice Chord from Tsubasa-senpai, and had no part in creating it myself.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:47.100
That's why I at least want to make this Premium Rare Dress myself.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:50.860
To prove that I'm the muse of Spice Chord now.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.860
You're wonderful, Rola.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:58.160
Despite all the abilities in singing and dancing you've cultivated,

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:02.120
you continue to work hard and take on new challenges.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.160
That's the part about you...

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:07.620
Rola?

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.380
<i>Keep at it, Rola. {this, however, I will not make a thing}{yeah}</i>

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:44.540
This is...

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:50.620
You usually only find these in brand headquarters, 
so you probably haven't had the chance to see one before.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:56.300
Go on, try touching that rose.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:58.260
Like this?

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:19.110
That's how dresses are turned into cards.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.530
This gets me going...

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:24.070
Thank you!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.380
There are so many visitors!

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:36.340
Look.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:40.260
Don't you think those are your fans?

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:46.220
I'm wearing the Girly Checkered One-piece from Berry Parfait.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:48.520
Lucky you. It's so cute!

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:52.520
I got this accessory to match Yume-chan!

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.020
I'm so happy!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:59.280
Doesn't it look like those girls are wearing Spice Chord?

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:00.490
You're right!

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:07.790
What a childish coord.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:11.080
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:14.210
Yume-chan's brand is really cute!

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:18.050
Sure it is. I'm just saying that Rola-chan's is much cuter.

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:20.880
Huh? Doesn't it look like they're fighting?

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:22.930
Baa!

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:28.430
You girls! If you don't stop this pointless argument, then baa!

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.640
Baa!

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.310
Baa!

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.270
Look at all the sheep! {are you trying to make some sort of commentary here?}{...}

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:37.190
Just look at all her fans!

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:39.690
Not bad, Hanazono Kirara!

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.610
Victory belongs to Kirara-chan!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:43.700
Baa!

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:45.660
Yume-chan is number one!

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.950
Rola-chan isn't going to lose!

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:04.050
It all begins as a single drop.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:10.720
As they gather, a current forms, 
eventually becoming a wave with great power.

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:15.270
A wave that envelops the whole idol world.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:17.350
Welcome to Venus Wave!

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:26.360
Venus Wave will be streamed in real time to 32 different countries.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:30.280
Who of the numerous participants will emerge victorious?

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:34.200
Please join us for this exciting journey.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:38.000
And now, a greeting from our organizer.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:44.760
The owner and top idol of Venus Ark...

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:46.840
Elza Forte!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:02.270
What is an idol? {a miserable little pile of secrets}{something something love doll}

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:06.280
Some may say one is <i>just</i> an idol.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:13.290
However, truly shining idols pierce the hearts of those who lay eyes upon them, granting great power.

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:21.790
My wish is to find idols as brilliant as stars 
and allow them to create waves in your hearts.

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:26.340
Now, let Venus Wave begin!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:33.470
Allow me to explain the basic premise.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:38.350
Each participant is the muse of their own brand.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:42.480
After explaining what their brand is about, they'll demonstrate it with a performance.

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:45.980
This is the outfit they will all be wearing.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:47.950
Huh, what?

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.490
A plain T-shirt?

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:54.990
As you might be thinking, it wouldn't be very interesting if everyone wore the same thing.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:15:00.790
We've asked everyone here to arrange their white T-shirt in accordance with their brand's concept.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:04.290
Don't you want to see what they've all come up with?

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:10.130
Okay. Then let's get this started!

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:14.470
First up, from Venus Ark... Mimoza!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.220
It started!

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.060
Yeah!

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:19.640
Yume-chan, Rola!

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:22.060
Here, for each of you.

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.980
It's candy!

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:27.320
Did you make these yourself?

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.650
Yeah.

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:37.160
They're a bit misshapen, but I made them wishing you'd be able to smile and do your very best.

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.960
Thanks, Koharu-chan!

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.170
I'll give it all I've got!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:42.670
Great!

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:48.960
Next to take the stage, from Venus Ark... Erika!

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:53.590
The event is proceeding well, Elza-sama.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:54.970
That it is.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:16:03.190
As the popularity of idols climbs, more will join the fray, thus raising the probability of Star Wings appearing.

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:09.530
By pitting them against one another, their hidden powers will be released.

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:13.740
Come to me, new star.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.460
Rola, you're up next.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:26.880
Okay!

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:30.880
Next is a first for Venus Wave—

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.470
From Four Star Academy... Sakuraba Rola!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.890
Her brand is Spice Chord.

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:40.220
Rola-chan is the coolest!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.100
Welcome, Rola.

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:44.650
What's the key point of your coord?

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:50.730
I adorned it with both casual and chic accessories to prevent it from being too spicy. {I think the biggest thing here is that karakuchi apparently means salty? or apparently karai can mean salty too. Never knew that. obviously it's spicy though}

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.780
I call it a sweet spice mix. {I think I wanted to write it the other way initially, but it's a nice reference to the song Sweet Sp!ce}

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:55.030
It's a coordinate sandwich!{I feel like this shouldn't this but}{I did think about it, but the only real english alternative is just coord. or coordinated to change the type of speech}

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:58.530
That's quite intriguing.

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:02.450
I heard that Spice Chord had more of a cool image, though.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:05.460
Doesn't adding sweetness to it twist that image? {considered unbalance/twist}

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.000
So what if it's twisted?

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:10.170
What?

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:11.170
I don't get it.

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:16.180
I'm not sure that's something a brand muse should be saying.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:20.220
If the muse twists things, wouldn't that throw the brand off its image?

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.930
It wouldn't be interesting without change.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:25.810
I figured it out after all my Aikatsu.

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:30.020
I tried all sorts of new things and made discoveries each time.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:34.280
It was a lot of fun watching myself change bit by bit.

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:39.120
I don't think there are any hard-and-fast rules to designing a coord.{this is a contentious hyphen set, but}

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:44.000
You just have to challenge yourself however you want and find your very own coord.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:47.830
Don't you think? Dresses should embody freedom.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.000
<i>Rola...</i>

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.840
I'll believe in myself and keep going my way!

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:56.260
This is my Spice Chord!

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:06.100
I see. Please show us what kind of performance you can create after going your way.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:11.610
<i>Rock My Heart Coord.</i>

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:15.610
<i>A rock-inspired coolness combined with vivid pink ribbons—</i>

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:20.200
<i>Together with the cuteness of the 
checkered frills, this is a new Spice Chord.</i>

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:25.500
Sakuraba Rola—it's my time to shine!

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:28.640
Rola's dress... got wings!

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:31.260
You did it, Rola.

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:33.020
I'm so glad.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:35.940
Rola-chan's awesome!

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:41.650
Amazing... you're amazing, Rola!

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:44.950
That was the most incredible performance you've ever had!

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:47.950
Star Wings.

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:53.450
Rola Sakuraba. I knew she was blessed with a talent for singing...

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:57.420
But to think she would obtain a Star Premium Rare Coord...

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:01.460
That makes three from Four Star Academy.

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:04.260
It's turning out to be a remarkable school.

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:07.090
Yes, it's a happy miscalculation.

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:09.470
Mars Wings.

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:13.560
That makes five.

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:18.940
<i>I've encountered a lot of interesting things in my life,</i>

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:23.400
<i>but Aikatsu gets me going the most!</i>

00:23:55.870 --> 00:24:00.410
It's not just cool—the Rock My Heart Coord mixes in sweetness too.

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:02.580
So this is your very own Spice Chord!

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:04.710
Yeah, it's going my way!

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:10.050
I'm gonna keep on doing my own Aikatsu, 
designing how I want and taking on new challenges!

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:12.550
It's the second half of Venus Wave!

00:24:12.550 --> 00:24:15.140
It looks like the competition is spilling into the stands!

00:24:15.140 --> 00:24:18.390
Everyone! Fighting is baaad!

00:24:18.390 --> 00:24:20.180
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.180 --> 00:24:21.480
Send a cheer.

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:23.810
Become the first-star idol!
